<title>USA: Continental Bank names John Sullivan CEO.</title>
<headline>Continental Bank names John Sullivan CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Bank said Friday it had named John Sullivan as its president and chief executive officer.  </p>
<p>The bank said Sullivan would replace Edward McAdams, who had resigned for personal reasons.</p>
<p>Sullivan was president of East River Savings Bank of New York City, it added.</p>
<p>Continental is an independent Long Island community bank based in Garden City, N.Y. with assets totalling more than $140 million.</p>
